<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-22T16:30:00.040Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican special forces captured cartel leader El Chapo Isidro in northern Sinaloa after a firefight that left eleven people dead, sparking gun battles, vehicle burnings and gunshots that disrupted a local baseball match. The raid has triggered renewed violence linked to the Sinaloa cartel and an increase in migrant caravan movements toward the U.S. border. This escalation follows the earlier capture and adds a surge in local conflict and migration pressure. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZ3ZrbUhDcHRheWFRRDhZWFVhYng0UElSUTdKT3lPSzc1c3o5RG5nRHc0ZjJTQjNLZ2cyNWtKRzhub2VLckVvSWRRZy1aWEpRaEVCUmNIeFVZVlUxYmVsVHg1ZEgxQ000V1ptV19FQTRpSUJhcHRnNUdvZndxMnlvelp5T3MzckRTNEI4?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOa2RiNXlYT1VFSmc3cEJmU0N4QW9Ydk9rX1RBZ3hvakVOYWtIa1ZDdGlhVm8wSUp5MUk2bWg0TFNyc2lvN3VXazhaamp3WTZBOVpqXzBPcnV5OVVGREVtU1FNVDBXb2d2ck5mVmhybmptaUtCMGRJNEt0UGhxU25fM0JWZE5NSUF2NmRxZVlZOGJSaUpncmt6dnFkNEpDdG9ZejlidXU5RnJUdm8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPZHBDbG9GYkxsaWpTYlVjUlZpYzJlcmI4SHI5VzFWVGJyd3U5NUlwcUxGNzFrelVYODMwSDgwaERhRHhWV2U4VDgxY3B5V1ZkMk9UQUp6ckk1b0Y1Ml92dUIyWTdBUXZJUkxOU3BmY21CXzRnMXZ1WjR4bmRobW1QZmdiMzNtZ2xSNTRYcmVsV2dHdk5NeTA3OV9uV25jc1p3eWphX0ZuakgwSkQtMHNnVFhycw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CB